# Single source for the mainnet bootnode peer id (B27).
# The id is derived from the bootnode's key, which exists only after the mainnet
# genesis ceremony (gate 5). SET AT GENESIS: replace the placeholder, then copy the
# value into any join path that names a mainnet bootnode. Testnet paths keep the
# testnet id; see the testnet guides.
MAINNET_BOOTNODE_PEER_ID=SET-AT-GENESIS
